graph TD
    A[Regulatory Signal] --> B{Regulation Type?}
    B -->|Activation| C[Activator Binding]
    B -->|Repression| D[Repressor Binding]
    B -->|Enhancer| E[Enhancer Binding]
    B -->|Silencer| F[Silencer Binding]
    
    C --> G[Coactivator Recruitment]
    G --> H[Chromatin Remodeling]
    H --> I[Transcription Activation]
    
    D --> J[Corepressor Recruitment]
    J --> K[Chromatin Condensation]
    K --> L[Transcription Repression]
    
    E --> M[Enhancer-Promoter Loop]
    M --> N[Transcription Enhancement]
    
    F --> O[Silencer-Promoter Loop]
    O --> P[Transcription Silencing]
    
    I --> Q[Transcription Regulation Complete]
    L --> Q
    N --> Q
    P --> Q
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> R[Post-Translational Modification]
    R --> S[Regulatory Protein Modification]
    S --> T[Regulation Response]
    T --> Q
    
    %% Regulation
    Q --> U[Regulation Status]
    U --> V{Regulation Required?}
    V -->|Yes| W[Regulation Activation]
    V -->|No| X[Regulation Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    Y[Activators] --> C
    Z[Repressors] --> D
    AA[Enhancers] --> E
    BB[Silencers] --> F
    CC[Coactivators] --> G
    DD[Corepressors] --> J
    EE[Regulatory Proteins] --> S
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#ff6b6b
    style B fill:#45b7d1
